(GBHS Kumbo Ex-Students Association) Tj T*
(Short bylaws) Tj T*
(Version 2026-1) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Name) Tj T*
(The association is the GBHS Kumbo Ex-Students Association,) Tj T*
(for former students of Government Bilingual High School Kumbo.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Membership) Tj T*
(A former student may apply with a phone number and the) Tj T*
(details the association asks for. Membership begins when) Tj T*
(the application is approved and a membership number is issued.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Annual registration) Tj T*
(Each member registers once every calendar year.) Tj T*
(The executive sets the annual registration amount.) Tj T*
(A member who does not register that year stays on the roll) Tj T*
(but is not in good standing until the registration is paid.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Conduct) Tj T*
(Members treat one another with respect.) Tj T*
(Nobody collects money in the association name) Tj T*
(unless the executive has agreed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Money) Tj T*
(A contribution is received only after the association) Tj T*
(or the payment provider confirms it.) Tj T*
(Cancelled and reversed amounts are not counted as received.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Meetings) Tj T*
(The executive calls a general meeting at least once a year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. Changes) Tj T*
(These bylaws change only when a general meeting agrees) Tj T*
(and a new version is published.) Tj T*
ET
